<Layout title="About | ATELIER Estates — Fictional Brokerage" description="The creative concept behind ATELIER Estates, a fictional premium real estate website." brand="ATELIER / ESTATES" nav={nav(p)} accent="#242423"><section class="page-heading container"><p class="eyebrow">THE CONCEPT / NOT A REAL BROKERAGE</p><h1>Curated, never<br>crowded<span class="period">.</span></h1><p>ATELIER Estates is a fictional brand created to demonstrate a quiet, editorial approach to luxury property discovery.</p></section><section class="container editorial-guide"><div><h2>Built around place and detail.</h2></div><div><p>The experience prioritizes relevant search, clear property specifications, considered architectural visuals and accessible browsing on every screen.</p><p>There are no claims of a brokerage license, clients, completed transactions, years in business or real property inventory. Every illustrated home is a sample.</p><a class="solid-button" href={`${p}properties/`}>Explore the collection ↗</a></div></section></Layout>
